 "custom-code-tWZjqM": "<section class=\"ug-intro\" id=\"intro\">\n<style>\n.ug-intro{background:#0b0b0b;color:#fff;padding:40px 24px 44px;font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;text-align:center}\n.ug-intro__wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto}\n.ug-intro h1{font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px);line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin:0 0 14px}\n.ug-intro h1 span{color:#e8622c}\n.ug-intro p{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#d9d9d9}\n.ug-intro a{color:#e8622c;text-decoration:underline}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ug-intro__wrap\">\n<h1>Breckenridge Snowboard Shop <span>on Main Street Since 1988</span></h1>\n<p>Underground Snowboards is Breck's core snowboard shop at 320 S Main St, owned and run by snowboarders. Shop snowboards, boots, bindings, splitboards and outerwear from Burton, Jones, Arbor, YES, Union, 686 and Volcom, plus Korua, Jones and Burton demos and Burton Step On rentals. Open 10am to 7pm daily, then winter hours of 9am to 8pm daily starting Black Friday (Nov 27), with free pickup at the shop, or shipping anywhere in the US at carrier rates. <a href=\"/products\">Shop the catalog</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</section>",
 "custom-code-qu5km3": "<style id=\"ug-home-mobile\">@media(max-width:600px){#ec-instantsite #tile-custom-7iz5CF .hero-banner__background{height:236px!important;padding:16px 24px 0!important}#ec-instantsite #tile-custom-7iz5CF .hero-banner__background img{height:220px!important;width:100%!important;padding:0!important;object-fit:contain!important}#ec-instantsite #tile-custom-7iz5CF .hero-banner__content{padding-top:16px!important;padding-bottom:40px!important}}</style><style id=\"ug-site-css\">.contact-me-container{justify-items:center}.copyright-section{align-items:center;text-align:center;width:100%}.copyright-section .copyright{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto}</style>\n<section class=\"ug-locals\" id=\"locals-day\">\n<style>\n.ug-locals{background:#0b0b0b;color:#fff;padding:72px 24px;font-family:'Inter',system-ui,Arial,sans-serif}\n.ug-locals__wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;gap:40px}\n@media(min-width:900px){.ug-locals__wrap{grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;align-items:center}}\n.ug-locals .ug-locals__eyebrow{color:#e8622c!important;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 12px}\n.ug-locals h2{font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,80px);line-height:.92;margin:0 0 20px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:.02em}\n.ug-locals p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#d6d6d6;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:560px}\n.ug-locals__card{border:2px solid #e8622c;padding:32px}\n.ug-locals__card dl{margin:0;display:grid;gap:18px}\n.ug-locals__card dt{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e8622c;margin:0 0 4px}\n.ug-locals__card dd{margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}\n.ug-locals__card dd span{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#bdbdbd;margin-top:2px}\n.ug-locals__btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;background:#fff;color:#0b0b0b!important;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:13px;padding:16px 28px;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid #fff}\n.ug-locals__btn:hover{background:#e8622c;border-color:#e8622c}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ug-locals__wrap\">\n  <div>\n    <p class=\"ug-locals__eyebrow\">Annual Locals Appreciation Day</p>\n    <h2>Locals Day Sale &amp; After Party</h2>\n    <p>Once a year we say thanks to the crew that keeps Breck weird. It kicks off with the Locals Day Sale at the shop on Thursday, November 5, the day before Breck opens: 20% off 2027 gear, 20% off pre-orders and special orders, extra savings on sale gear, and Spend &amp; Win. Pre-shop now and put gear on layaway to lock it in. The next Friday, we roll down to the Riverwalk for the After Party: snowboard films on the big screen, a DJ on the mic between showings, a raffle, and a bar.</p>\n    <p>Every ticket gives back. Proceeds go to Summit County Rescue Group, with part of the night raising money for Sy Moran's Recovery Fund.</p>\n    <a class=\"ug-locals__btn\" href=\"/products/underground-2026-locals-day-after-party-ticket\">Get tickets</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ug-locals__card\">\n    <dl>\n      <div><dt>Locals Day Sale</dt><dd>Thursday, November 5, 2026<span>20% off 2027 gear + pre-orders, at the shop</span></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>After Party</dt><dd>Friday, November 13, 2026<span>Evening. Final times coming soon.</span></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Riverwalk Center<span>150 W Adams Ave, Breckenridge</span></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Tickets</dt><dd>$30<span>Buy online or grab yours at the shop</span></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Benefiting</dt><dd>Summit County Rescue Group<span>+ Sy Moran's Recovery Fund</span></dd></div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n[{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SaleEvent\",\"name\":\"Underground Snowboards Locals Day Sale\",\"startDate\":\"2026-11-05\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Underground Snowboards\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"320 S Main St\",\"addressLocality\":\"Breckenridge\",\"addressRegion\":\"CO\",\"postalCode\":\"80424\",\"addressCountry\":\"US\"}},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Underground Snowboards\",\"url\":\"https://www.undergroundsnowboards.com\"}},\n{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Underground Snowboards Locals Day After Party\",\"description\":\"Annual Locals Appreciation Day after party with snowboard films, a DJ and a raffle. Proceeds benefit Summit County Rescue Group and Sy Moran's Recovery Fund.\",\"startDate\":\"2026-11-13\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Riverwalk Center\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"150 W Adams Ave\",\"addressLocality\":\"Breckenridge\",\"addressRegion\":\"CO\",\"postalCode\":\"80424\",\"addressCountry\":\"US\"}},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Underground Snowboards\",\"url\":\"https://www.undergroundsnowboards.com\",\"telephone\":\"+1-970-453-7400\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"30\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"url\":\"https://www.undergroundsnowboards.com/products/underground-2026-locals-day-after-party-ticket\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"}}]\n</script>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var OPEN=new Date('2026-11-06T09:00:00-07:00').getTime();\n  function p(n){return (n<10?'0':'')+n}\n  function label(){\n    var ms=OPEN-Date.now();\n    if(ms<=0) return 'Breck is open. Go ride.';\n    var s=Math.floor(ms/1000),d=Math.floor(s/86400),h=Math.floor(s%86400/3600),m=Math.floor(s%3600/60),x=s%60;\n    return 'Breck opens in '+d+'d '+p(h)+'h '+p(m)+'m '+p(x)+'s';\n  }\n  function tick(){\n    var bars=document.querySelectorAll('.key-info-bar');\n    for(var i=0;i<bars.length;i++){\n      var b=bars[i],sp=b.querySelector('.ug-cd');\n      if(!sp){\n        if(b.textContent.indexOf('Breck opens Fri, Nov 6')<0) continue;\n        b.innerHTML=b.innerHTML.replace('Breck opens Fri, Nov 6','<span class=\"ug-cd\" style=\"font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\"></span>');\n        sp=b.querySelector('.ug-cd');\n      }\n      sp.textContent=label();\n    }\n  }\n  tick(); setInterval(tick,1000);\n})();\n</script>\n</section>\n",
