columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.ug-fleet__credit{grid-template-columns:1fr auto;padding:28px 32px}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__wrap\">\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__top\">\n<div><p class=\"ug-fleet__eyebrow\">The demo fleet</p><h2>Demo before you buy</h2></div>\n<p class=\"ug-fleet__lead\">Don't rent a shitty board. Demo the good stuff: Korua, Jones, Burton, Burton Step On and more. Set up at the shop on Main Street. <b><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge#book\" style=\"color:#e8622c!important;text-decoration:underline!important\">Book online</a> or call <a href=\"tel:+19704537400\" style=\"color:#fff!important\">970.453.7400</a>.</b></p>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"ug-fleet__boards\">\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869119425/6302340663.webp\" alt=\"Korua Pencil demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Korua</b>Pencil</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869119428/6302381680.webp\" alt=\"Korua Otto demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Korua</b>Otto</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869123570/6302954455.webp\" alt=\"Korua Dart demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Korua</b>Dart</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869119418/6302380168.webp\" alt=\"Korua Caf\u00e9 Racer demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Korua</b>Caf\u00e9 Racer</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869125032/6302382188.webp\" alt=\"Jones Mountain Twin demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Jones</b>Mountain Twin</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869123557/6302380444.webp\" alt=\"Jones Flagship demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Jones</b>Flagship</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869119412/6302952805.webp\" alt=\"Jones Dream Weaver demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Jones</b>Dream Weaver</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869123563/6302380465.webp\" alt=\"Burton Process demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Burton</b>Process</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869119417/6302339037.webp\" alt=\"Burton Cartographer demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Burton</b>Cartographer</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869125052/6302958087.webp\" alt=\"Burton Yeasayer demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Burton</b>Yeasayer</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869123568/6302953403.webp\" alt=\"Burton Story Board demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Burton</b>Story Board</span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ug-fleet__card\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/products/869123577/6302957062.webp\" alt=\"Arbor Rain demo snowboard\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>Arbor</b>Rain</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__grid\">\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__brand\"><h3>Korua</h3><p class=\"ug-fleet__tag\">Surfy, carve-everything shapes</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Pencil</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Otto</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Dart</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Caf\u00e9 Racer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Transition Finder</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__brand\"><h3>Jones</h3><p class=\"ug-fleet__tag\">All-mountain and freeride</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Men's Mountain Twin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Men's Flagship</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Women's Dream Weaver</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__brand\"><h3>Burton</h3><p class=\"ug-fleet__tag\">Park, groomers and everything between</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Men's Process</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Men's Cartographer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Women's Yeasayer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Women's Story Board</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__brand\"><h3>Burton Step On</h3><p class=\"ug-fleet__tag\">Click in, no straps</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Men's Highshot Step On boots and bindings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Women's Felix Step On boots and bindings</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__brand\"><h3>Arbor and Slash</h3><p class=\"ug-fleet__tag\">More boards to try</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Arbor Men's Rain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Slash Men's Paxson</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__brand\"><h3>Boots and bindings</h3><p class=\"ug-fleet__tag\">Dial the rest of your setup</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Jones Mercury FASE bindings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Rome Katana AW FASE bindings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Burton Men's Ruler BOA boots</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Burton Women's Limelight BOA boots</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"ug-fleet__prices\">\n<li>Board, boots and bindings <b>$79.85/day</b></li>\n<li>Board and bindings <b>$64.90/day</b></li>\n<li>Board with Step On boots and bindings <b>$99.85/day</b></li>\n<li>3+ pieces <b>10% off with PACKAGE10</b></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__credit\">\n<div><h3>Demo it, then buy it</h3><p>Buy a new board from us within 30 days of your demo and your demo day comes off the price. Keep your demo receipt.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ug-fleet__btns\"><a class=\"ug-fleet__btn\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge#book\">Book a rental</a><a class=\"ug-fleet__btn ug-fleet__btn--ghost\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">See rental prices</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n",
 "custom-code-Xciktd": "<section class=\"ug-bc\" id=\"backcountry\">\n<style>\n.ug-bc{background:#0b0b0b;color:#fff;padding:72px 24px;font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif}\n.ug-bc__wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}\n.ug-bc__eyebrow{color:#e8622c;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 12px}\n.ug-bc h2{font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);line-height:.95;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 20px;color:#fff}\n.ug-bc__lede{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;max-width:760px;color:#ddd;margin:0 0 36px}\n.ug-bc__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:36px}\n@media(min-width:760px){.ug-bc__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}\n.ug-bc__tile{display:block;border:2px solid #fff;padding:22px 20px;color:#fff!important;text-decoration:none!important;transition:background .15s,color .15s}\n.ug-bc__tile:hover{background:#fff;color:#0b0b0b!important}\n.ug-bc__tile:hover p{color:#333}\n.ug-bc h3{font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px}\n.ug-bc__tile p{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#bbb}\n.ug-bc__note{border-left:4px solid #e8622c;padding:4px 0 4px 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#ddd;max-width:860px;margin:0 0 32px}\n.ug-bc__note a{color:#e8622c!important}\n.ug-bc__ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}\n.ug-bc__btn{display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none!important;border:2px solid #fff}\n.ug-bc__btn--solid{background:#e8622c;border-color:#e8622c;color:#0b0b0b!important}\n.ug-bc__btn--line{color:#fff!important}\n.ug-bc__btn--line:hover{background:#fff;color:#0b0b0b!important}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ug-bc__wrap\">\n<p class=\"ug-bc__eyebrow\">Splitboards \u00b7 Skins \u00b7 Touring Gear</p>\n<h2>We Ride the Backcountry Too</h2>\n<p class=\"ug-bc__lede\">When Breck gets tracked out, the crew is skinning Hoosier Pass, Mayflower Gulch and Loveland Pass. We stock Jones splitboards, Spark R&amp;D and Karakoram split bindings, Jones skins and the small parts that keep a tour going, and we'll get your setup dialed before you head out.</p>\n<div class=\"ug-bc__grid\">\n<a class=\"ug-bc__tile\" href=\"https://undergroundsnowboards.com/products/splitboards\"><h3>Splitboards</h3><p>Jones splits built for touring Summit County, with more landing soon.</p></a>\n<a class=\"ug-bc__tile\" href=\"https://undergroundsnowboards.com/products/splitboard-bindings\"><h3>Split Bindings</h3><p>Spark R&amp;D and Karakoram. Light going up, locked in coming down.</p></a>\n<a class=\"ug-bc__tile\" href=\"https://undergroundsnowboards.com/products/splitboard-skins\"><h3>Skins and Parts</h3><p>Jones skins, Spark pucks and spares. We cut and rivet skins to fit your board.</p></a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"ug-bc__note\">Read the <a href=\"https://avalanche.state.co.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CAIC avalanche forecast</a> every time you go. Beacon, shovel and probe for every person on every tour, and take an avalanche course. We want to see you back at the shop telling stories.</p>\n<div class=\"ug-bc__ctas\">\n<a class=\"ug-bc__btn ug-bc__btn--solid\" href=\"https://undergroundsnowboards.com/products/splitboard\">Shop Splitboard Gear</a>\n<a class=\"ug-bc__btn ug-bc__btn--line\" href=\"https://undergroundsnowboards.com/breckenridge-backcountry-splitboarding\">Backcountry Guide</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
 "custom-code-JRVpxW": "<section class=\"ug-svc\" id=\"services\">\n<style>\n.ug-svc{background:#fff;color:#0b0b0b;padding:72px 24px;font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif}\n.ug-svc__wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}\n.ug-svc__eyebrow{color:#e8622c;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 12px}\n.ug-svc h2{font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);line-height:.95;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 32px}\n.ug-svc__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}\n.ug-svc__tile{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:2px solid #0b0b0b;padding:22px 20px;color:#0b0b0b!important;text-decoration:none!important;background:#fff;transition:background .15s,color .15s}\n.ug-svc__tile:hover{background:#0b0b0b;color:#fff!important}\n.ug-svc__tile:hover p{color:#ddd}\n.ug-svc__icon{width:36px;height:36px;fill:none;stroke:#e8622c;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;margin-bottom:12px}\n.ug-svc h3{font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:32px;line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 10px}\n.ug-svc p{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#333;flex:1}\n.ug-svc__cta{font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12.5px;border-bottom:2px solid #e8622c;align-self:flex-start;padding-bottom:3px}\n@media(min-width:600px){.ug-svc__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.ug-svc__tile{padding:28px 24px}.ug-svc__icon{margin-bottom:18px}}\n@media(min-width:1000px){.ug-svc{padding:96px 40px}.ug-svc__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr))}.ug-svc__tile{padding:24px 18px}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ug-svc__wrap\">\n<p class=\"ug-svc__eyebrow\">In the shop and online</p>\n<h2>How we've got you</h2>\n<div class=\"ug-svc__grid\">\n<a class=\"ug-svc__tile\" href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\"><svg class=\"ug-svc__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g transform=\"rotate(35 12 12)\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"1.5\" width=\"6\" height=\"21\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M9 8.5h6M9 15.5h6\"/></g></svg><h3>Demos &amp; Rentals</h3><p>Demo the good stuff on Peak 8 before you commit: Korua, Jones, Burton and Burton Step On, the easiest setup for first-timers. Grab your gear the night before and skip the morning line. Book online or call 970.453.7400.</p><span class=\"ug-svc__cta\">See rental prices and book</span></a>\n<a class=\"ug-svc__tile\" href=\"/products\"><svg class=\"ug-svc__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10l2-6h14l2 6\"/><path d=\"M4 10h16v10H4z\"/><path d=\"M10 20v-5h4v5\"/></svg><h3>Order on the drive up</h3><p>Order before you hit I-70 and it&#39;s bagged and waiting at 320 S Main St. Pickup is free, and we&#39;ll email you when it&#39;s ready.</p><span class=\"ug-svc__cta\">Shop online</span></a>\n<a class=\"ug-svc__tile\" href=\"/products\"><svg class=\"ug-svc__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10l2-6h14l2 6\"/><path d=\"M4 10h16v10H4z\"/><path d=\"M10 20v-5h4v5\"/></svg><h3>Delivered to your condo</h3><p>Staying in Breck? Order by 3pm and our crew drops it at your condo, hotel or rental that evening for $15.</p><span class=\"ug-svc__cta\">Shop online</span></a>\n<a class=\"ug-svc__tile\" href=\"/products/snowboards\"><svg class=\"ug-svc__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L3 18l3 3 6.3-6.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.6 2.6-2.4-.6-.6-2.4z\"/></svg><h3>Free mount and wax</h3><p>Buy a board and bindings from us and we mount them and wax the board free, so it&#39;s ready for Peak 6 through 10.</p><span class=\"ug-svc__cta\">Shop snowboards</span></a>\n<a class=\"ug-svc__tile\" href=\"/products/shop-services\"><svg class=\"ug-svc__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L3 18l3 3 6.3-6.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.6 2.6-2.4-.6-.6-2.4z\"/></svg><h3>Shop Services</h3><p>Binding mounts $30, boot heat molding $40, BOA repair $30 and splitboard skin cut and rivet $60. Book it online and bring your gear by.</p><span class=\"ug-svc__cta\">See services</span></a>\n<a class=\"ug-svc__tile\" href=\"/shipping-returns\"><svg class=\"ug-svc__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 7l9-4 9 4v10l-9 4-9-4z\"/><path d=\"M3 7l9 4 9-4\"/><path d=\"M12 11v10\"/></svg><h3>Buy here, ship it home</h3><p>Skip the airline fight. Buy in the shop and we&#39;ll ship it home at carrier rates. Out of your size? We&#39;ll order it and send it to you.</p><span class=\"ug-svc__cta\">Shipping and returns</span></a>\n<a class=\"ug-svc__tile\" href=\"/shipping-returns\"><svg class=\"ug-svc__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 7l9-4 9 4v10l-9 4-9-4z\"/><path d=\"M3 7l9 4 9-4\"/><path d=\"M12 11v10\"/></svg><h3>Shipping &amp; Returns</h3><p>Most orders ship the next business day at carrier rates. Online orders can come back within 30 days.</p><span class=\"ug-svc__cta\">Shipping and returns</span></a>\n<a class=\"ug-svc__tile\" href=\"/size-guide\"><svg class=\"ug-svc__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 17L17 3l4 4L7 21z\"/><path d=\"M7 13l2 2M10 10l2 2M13 7l2 2\"/></svg><h3>Size Guide</h3><p>Not sure on length or width? Our size guide breaks down how boards, boots and bindings should fit.</p><span class=\"ug-svc__cta\">Dial your size</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- UG gift card band (added Oct 19, 2026) -->\n<section class=\"ug-gc\"><style>\n.ug-gc{background:#0b0b0b;background-image:radial-gradient(60% 90% at 18% 50%,rgba(232,98,44,.26),transparent 65%);color:#fff;overflow:hidden;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}\n.ug-gc *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.ug-gc__in{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:88px 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}\n.ug-gc__art{display:block;text-decoration:none!important}\n.ug-gc__card{position:relative;display:block;width:min(100%,440px);margin:0 auto;aspect-ratio:1.586;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 28px;transform:rotate(-7deg);transition:transform .35s ease;background:repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,transparent 0 18px,rgba(255,255,255,.035) 18px 19px),linear-gradient(155deg,#222 0%,#0b0b0b 62%);box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.75),inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.14);overflow:hidden}\n.ug-gc__card:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:10px;background:#e8622c}\n.ug-gc__art:hover .ug-gc__card{transform:translateY(-8px) rotate(-3deg)}\n.ug-gc__brand{display:block;font:400 clamp(40px,6vw,62px)/.9 'Bebas Neue',Oswald,Impact,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff}\n.ug-gc__sub{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#bdb8ae}\n.ug-gc__tag{position:absolute;right:28px;bottom:30px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e8622c}\n.ug-gc__eye{color:#e8622c;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 12px}\n.ug-gc h2{font:400 clamp(44px,5.5vw,72px)/.95 'Bebas Neue',Oswald,Impact,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#fff;margin:0 0 16px}\n.ug-gc__p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#d6d3cc;margin:0 0 26px;max-width:460px}\n.ug-gc__btn{display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0b0b0b!important;text-decoration:none!important;padding:15px 26px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;border:2px solid #fff;transition:all .2s}\n.ug-gc__btn:hover{background:#e8622c;border-color:#e8622c}\n@media(max-width:900px){.ug-gc__in{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:56px 20px 60px;gap:40px}.ug-gc__card{width:86%}.ug-gc__p{font-size:16px}}\n</style><div class=\"ug-gc__in\"><a class=\"ug-gc__art\" href=\"/products/underground-digital-gift-card\" aria-label=\"Underground digital gift card\"><span class=\"ug-gc__card\"><span class=\"ug-gc__brand\">Underground</span><span class=\"ug-gc__sub\">Breckenridge &middot; Since 1988</span><span class=\"ug-gc__tag\">Gift Card</span></span></a><div><p class=\"ug-gc__eye\">Gift Cards</p><h2>Let them pick the setup</h2><p class=\"ug-gc__p\">Boards, boots, bindings, outerwear. Spend it on Main St or online. Always the right size, never the wrong color.</p><a class=\"ug-gc__btn\" href=\"/products/underground-digital-gift-card\">Grab a gift card</a></div></div></section>",
 "custom-code-LoT5th": "<section class=\"ug-visit\" id=\"visit\">\n<style>\n.ug-visit{background:#0b0b0b;color:#fff;font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif}\n.ug-visit__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}\n.ug-visit__info{padding:64px 24px}\n.ug-visit__eyebrow{color:#e8622c;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 12px}\n.ug-visit h2{font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);line-height:.95;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 24px;color:#fff}\n.ug-visit p{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#ddd}\n.ug-visit a{color:#fff}\n.ug-visit__addr{font-size:20px!important;color:#fff!important;font-weight:600}\n.ug-visit__btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;background:#e8622c;color:#0b0b0b!important;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:13px;padding:16px 26px}\n.ug-visit__btn:hover{background:#fff}\n.ug-visit__map{min-height:360px}\n.ug-visit__map a{display:block;height:100%}.ug-visit__map{background:#0b0b0b}.ug-visit__map img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:360px;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%}\n@media(min-width:900px){.ug-visit__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr}.ug-visit__info{padding:96px 56px}.ug-visit__map,.ug-visit__map img{min-height:480px}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ug-visit__grid\">\n<div class=\"ug-visit__info\">\n<p class=\"ug-visit__eyebrow\">Find the shop</p>\n<h2>Visit Underground</h2>\n<p class=\"ug-visit__addr\">320 S Main St<br>Breckenridge, CO 80424</p>\n<p><a href=\"tel:+19704537400\">970.453.7400</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:info@undergroundsnowboards.com\">info@undergroundsnowboards.com</a></p>\n<p>Open 10am to 7pm daily, then winter hours of 9am to 8pm daily starting Black Friday (Nov 27). Swing in to grab a demo, pick up an online order or just talk snow.</p>\n<a class=\"ug-visit__btn\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Underground+Snowboards%2C+320+S+Main+St%2C+Breckenridge%2C+CO+80424\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get directions</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ug-visit__map\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Underground%20Snowboards%2C%20320%20S%20Main%20St%2C%20Breckenridge%2C%20CO%2080424\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open Underground Snowboards, 320 S Main St, Breckenridge in Google Maps\"><img src=\"https://d2j6dbq0eux0bg.cloudfront.net/images/143171290/categories/207588543/6305385524.jpg\" alt=\"Map to Underground Snowboards, 320 S Main St, Breckenridge\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SportingGoodsStore\",\"@id\":\"https://www.undergroundsnowboards.com/#store\",\"name\":\"Underground Snowboards\",\"alternateName\":\"Underground Breckenridge\",\"description\":\"Breckenridge snowboard shop on Main Street since 1988, owned and run by snowboarders. Snowboards, boots, bindings, splitboards and outerwear, and a demo fleet of Korua, Jones and Burton setups including Burton Step On. Binding mounts, boot heat molding, BOA repair and splitboard skin setup in the shop.\",\"url\":\"https://www.undergroundsnowboards.com/\",\"telephone\":\"+1-970-453-7400\",\"email\":\"info@undergroundsnowboards.com\",\"foundingDate\":\"1988\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"320 S Main St\",\"addressLocality\":\"Breckenridge\",\"addressRegion\":\"CO\",\"postalCode\":\"80424\",\"addressCountry\":\"US\"},\"openingHoursSpecification\":[{\"@type\":\"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\"dayOfWeek\":[\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\",\"Sunday\"],\"opens\":\"10:00\",\"closes\":\"19:00\"}],\"areaServed\":[\"Breckenridge\",\"Summit County, Colorado\"],\"hasMap\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Underground+Snowboards/@39.47887,-106.045413,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x7efbead951b16274\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://instagram.com/undergroundsnowboards/\",\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Underground-Snowboard-Shop/132671683424968\"],\"makesOffer\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Snowboard demos, including Burton Step On\"},\"price\":\"79.95\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Binding mount\"},\"price\":\"30\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Snowboard boot heat molding\"},\"price\":\"40\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"BOA repair\"},\"price\":\"30\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Splitboard skin cut and rivet\"},\"price\":\"60\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Korua, Jones and Burton snowboard demos\"},\"description\":\"Demo it, then buy it: your demo day comes off the price of a new board bought at Underground within 30 days.\"}],\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":39.47887,\"longitude\":-106.045413}}</script>\n</section>",
 "custom-code-nJcAWA": "<section class=\"ug-faq\" id=\"faq\">\n<style>\n.ug-faq{background:#fff;color:#0b0b0b;padding:72px 24px;font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif}\n.ug-faq__wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto}\n.ug-faq h2{font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);line-height:.95;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px}\n.ug-faq__intro{margin:0 0 32px;color:#444;font-size:16px}\n.ug-faq details{border-top:2px solid #0b0b0b}\n.ug-faq details:last-of-type{border-bottom:2px solid #0b0b0b}\n.ug-faq summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:20px 40px 20px 0;position:relative;font-weight:700;font-size:18px}\n.ug-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n.ug-faq summary::after{content:'+';position:absolute;right:4px;top:12px;font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:34px;color:#e8622c}\n.ug-faq details[open] summary::after{content:'\\2013'}\n.ug-faq details p{margin:0 0 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#222}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ug-faq__wrap\">\n<h2>Questions? We got you.</h2>\n<p class=\"ug-faq__intro\">The stuff people ask us at the counter every day.</p>\n<details><summary>Where is Underground Snowboards?</summary><p>320 S Main St in Breckenridge, Colorado. We've been Breck's snowboard shop since 1988, owned and run by snowboarders.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What are your hours?</summary><p>We are open 10am to 7pm daily, then winter hours of 9am to 8pm daily starting Black Friday (Nov 27). Call 970.453.7400 with any questions before you head over.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Do you have snowboard demo packages in Breckenridge?</summary><p>Yes. Our demo fleet includes board, boot and binding packages, and we're one of the only shops in Breck with a Burton Step On demo fleet. <a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">See rental prices and book online</a> or call 970.453.7400.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can I demo a board before I buy it?</summary><p>Yes. Take a Korua, Jones, Burton or another board from the demo fleet out for the day and see how it rides before you commit. Buy a new board from us within 30 days and your demo day comes off the price. <a href=\"/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge\">Book a demo online</a> or call 970.453.7400.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What brands do you carry?</summary><p>Snowboards, boots, bindings, splitboards and outerwear from Burton, Jones, Arbor, YES, Rome, Union, ThirtyTwo, 686, Volcom and more, plus Korua and Stranda, which most shops don't carry.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Do you ship?</summary><p>Yes, anywhere in the US with UPS and USPS. Shipping is calculated at checkout at live carrier rates based on what's in your box. Most orders ship the next business day. In Breck? Pick your order up free at the shop.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What's your return policy?</summary><p>Online orders can come back within 30 days of delivery. Gear needs to be brand new, unused, unwashed, in the original packaging with all tags attached, plus your receipt or proof of purchase. Sale items, electronics and safety gear like helmets and avalanche gear are final. Email info@undergroundsnowboards.com with your order number to start a return.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Do you carry splitboard gear?</summary><p>Yes. We stock splitboards, splitboard bindings, skins and split accessories for getting out past the ropes.</p></details>\n</div>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is Underground Snowboards?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"320 S Main St in Breckenridge, Colorado. We've been Breck's snowboard shop since 1988, owned and run by snowboarders.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are your hours?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We are open 10am to 7pm daily, then winter hours of 9am to 8pm daily starting Black Friday (Nov 27). Call 970.453.7400 with any questions before you head over.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you have snowboard demo packages in Breckenridge?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Our demo fleet includes board, boot and binding packages, and we're one of the only shops in Breck with a Burton Step On demo fleet. Book online at undergroundsnowboards.com/snowboard-rentals-breckenridge or call 970.453.7400.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I demo a board before I buy it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Take a Korua, Jones, Burton or another board from the demo fleet out for the day and see how it rides before you commit. Buy a new board from us within 30 days and your demo day comes off the price. Book online or call 970.453.7400.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What brands do you carry?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Snowboards, boots, bindings, splitboards and outerwear from Burton, Jones, Arbor, YES, Rome, Union, ThirtyTwo, 686, Volcom and more, plus Korua and Stranda, which most shops don't carry.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you ship?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, anywhere in the US with UPS and USPS. Shipping is calculated at checkout at live carrier rates based on what's in your box. Most orders ship the next business day. In Breck? Pick your order up free at the shop.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What's your return policy?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Online orders can come back within 30 days of delivery. Gear needs to be brand new, unused, unwashed, in the original packaging with all tags attached, plus your receipt or proof of purchase. Sale items, electronics and safety gear like helmets and avalanche gear are final. Email info@undergroundsnowboards.com with your order number to start a return.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you carry splitboard gear?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We stock splitboards, splitboard bindings, skins and split accessories for getting out past the ropes.\"}}]}</script>\n</section>"
